---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Yelly — CoolMode and hardware monitoring for Windows"
  description="A lightweight Windows companion for CoolMode, processor power limits, hotkeys, and live hardware monitoring."
>
  <header class="site-header">
    <div class="nav-wrap">
      <a class="brand" href="#top" aria-label="Yelly home">
        <img src="/Yelly.png" alt="" width="34" height="34" />
        <span>yelly</span>
        <span class="version">v1.5</span>
      </a>
      <nav aria-label="Main navigation">
        <a href="#features">Features</a>
        <a href="#monitor">Monitor</a>
        <a href="#controls">Controls</a>
        <a href="#autopilot">Autopilot</a>
      </nav>
      <div class="nav-actions">
        <a class="github-link" href="https://github.com/heshan-jj/yely-by-jj" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">GitHub <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        <a class="button button-small" href="#download">Get Yelly <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main id="top">
    <section class="hero section-wrap">
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <div class="eyebrow"><span class="live-dot"></span> A small, focused Windows utility</div>
        <h1>Keep your laptop cool.<br /><span>Stay in control.</span></h1>
        <p class="hero-lede">Yelly puts CoolMode, processor power limits, and useful hardware readings in one quiet desktop companion.</p>
        <div class="hero-actions" id="download">
          <a class="button" href="/downloads/YellySetup.exe" download>Download installer <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
          <a class="button button-outline" href="/downloads/Yelly.exe" download>Portable app</a>
        </div>
        <p class="microcopy">Windows · Lightweight · Runs from the system tray</p>
      </div>

      <figure class="app-shot hero-shot">
        <div class="shot-top"><span class="window-mark"><img src="/Yelly.png" alt="" width="16" height="16" /> Yelly <span class="shot-separator">/</span> Dashboard</span><span class="window-controls" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span></div>
        <img src="/screenshots/dashboard.png" alt="Yelly dark dashboard showing CoolMode status, CPU temperature, GPU temperature, and power readings" fetchpriority="high" />
        <figcaption><span class="live-dot"></span> A look at the dashboard <span class="caption-note">Example readings</span></figcaption>
      </figure>
    </section>

    <section class="trust-strip" aria-label="Yelly features">
      <div class="strip-inner"><span><b>01</b> CoolMode in one click</span><span><b>02</b> Live system readings</span><span><b>03</b> Custom keyboard shortcut</span><span><b>04</b> Automatic switching</span></div>
    </section>

    <section class="section-wrap feature-section" id="features">
      <div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">Useful at a glance</p><h2>The controls you need.<br /><span>Nothing in the way.</span></h2></div><p>Yelly keeps the everyday power and monitoring tools close, with a dark interface that feels at home on Windows.</p></div>
      <div class="feature-grid">
        <article class="feature-card feature-blue"><div class="feature-icon bolt" aria-hidden="true">ϟ</div><p class="card-kicker">POWER</p><h3>CoolMode, on your terms</h3><p>Toggle CoolMode from the dashboard, the tray menu, or a keyboard shortcut you choose.</p><span class="feature-foot"><span class="status-dot blue-dot"></span> One tap to switch</span></article>
        <article class="feature-card"><div class="feature-icon bars" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><p class="card-kicker">TELEMETRY</p><h3>Hardware at a glance</h3><p>See CPU and GPU temperatures, processor activity, memory, power, and available SSD health readings.</p><span class="feature-foot"><span class="status-dot green-dot"></span> Refreshes live</span></article>
        <article class="feature-card"><div class="feature-icon key-icon" aria-hidden="true">⌘</div><p class="card-kicker">SHORTCUT</p><h3>Make it one keystroke</h3><p>Set a global shortcut to switch CoolMode without leaving the app you’re in.</p><span class="feature-foot"><span class="status-dot amber-dot"></span> Set your own combo</span></article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="monitor-section" id="monitor">
      <div class="section-wrap monitor-layout">
        <div class="monitor-copy"><p class="eyebrow">Hardware monitor</p><h2>Your system,<br /><span>in plain sight.</span></h2><p>Check the components that matter without opening a heavyweight monitoring suite. Readings depend on what your hardware and Windows expose.</p>
          <ul class="reading-list"><li><span class="check">✓</span><span><b>CPU</b><small>Temperature, load, and processor details</small></span></li><li><span class="check">✓</span><span><b>Graphics</b><small>GPU temperature and device information</small></span></li><li><span class="check">✓</span><span><b>Storage</b><small>Drive details and SSD health data when available</small></span></li></ul>
        </div>
        <figure class="app-shot hardware-shot"><div class="shot-top"><span class="window-mark"><img src="/Yelly.png" alt="" width="16" height="16" /> Yelly <span class="shot-separator">/</span> Hardware</span><span class="window-controls" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span></div><img src="/screenshots/hardware-storage.png" alt="Yelly hardware monitor showing graphics adapter and storage drive details" loading="lazy" /><figcaption><span class="live-dot"></span> Hardware monitor <span class="caption-note">Example readings</span></figcaption></figure>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section-wrap controls-section" id="controls">
      <div class="controls-layout">
        <div class="controls-copy"><p class="eyebrow">Personal settings</p><h2>Set your limit.<br /><span>Pick your shortcut.</span></h2><p>Choose the maximum processor state Yelly applies in CoolMode, then assign a key combination that fits your workflow.</p><div class="setting-note"><span class="info-icon">i</span><span>Lower processor limits can reduce heat and power use, with a tradeoff in performance. Choose a value that works for your laptop.</span></div></div>
        <div class="settings-preview" aria-label="Example of Yelly processor cap and shortcut settings">
          <div class="settings-title"><span class="settings-symbol" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="17" height="17" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"/><path d="M19.4 15a1.7 1.7 0 0 0 .34 1.88l.06.06-1.7 2.94-.08-.02a1.7 1.7 0 0 0-1.82.56l-.05.07h-3.4l-.03-.08a1.7 1.7 0 0 0-1.5-1.13h-.09l-2.4-2.4.04-.08a1.7 1.7 0 0 0-.16-1.86l-.06-.07.88-3.28.09-.01a1.7 1.7 0 0 0 1.36-1.3l.02-.09 3.1-1.4.07.06a1.7 1.7 0 0 0 1.86.2l.08-.04 2.76 1.97-.01.09a1.7 1.7 0 0 0 .75 1.71l.08.05-.2 3.36-.08.03Z" transform="translate(-1 -1) scale(1.08)"/></svg></span><div><b>Quick controls</b><small>PERSONALIZE YELLY</small></div><span class="preview-label">PREVIEW</span></div>
          <div class="setting-row"><div><b>CoolMode processor cap</b><small>Maximum processor state</small></div><span class="value-pill">99% <span>⌄</span></span></div>
          <div class="cap-scale"><span></span><i></i></div><div class="scale-labels"><span>50%</span><span>100%</span></div>
          <div class="setting-row shortcut-row"><div><b>Toggle CoolMode</b><small>Global keyboard shortcut</small></div><kbd>Ctrl</kbd><b class="plus">+</b><kbd>Alt</kbd><b class="plus">+</b><kbd>K</kbd></div>
          <div class="settings-hint"><span class="live-dot"></span> Shortcut ready to customize</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="autopilot-section" id="autopilot"><div class="section-wrap autopilot-layout"><div><p class="eyebrow">Autopilot</p><h2>Let Yelly handle<br /><span>the switching.</span></h2><p>Set rules for battery power, selected apps, or CPU temperature. Yelly checks those rules automatically; you can still switch modes manually anytime.</p><a href="#download" class="text-link">Explore Yelly <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div><div class="rules-panel"><div class="rules-head"><span>YOUR AUTOMATION RULES</span><span class="enabled"><i></i> ENABLED</span></div><div class="rule-row"><span class="rule-icon blue-rule">⌁</span><div><b>On battery</b><small>Keep CoolMode on to help conserve power</small></div><span class="rule-check">✓</span></div><div class="rule-row"><span class="rule-icon amber-rule">▣</span><div><b>Selected app is running</b><small>Choose whether an app requests boost or CoolMode</small></div><span class="rule-check">✓</span></div><div class="rule-row"><span class="rule-icon green-rule">◷</span><div><b>CPU reaches your threshold</b><small>Turn on CoolMode when temperatures climb</small></div><span class="rule-check">✓</span></div><p class="rules-foot">Choose which rules to use in Autopilot settings.</p></div></div></section>

    <section class="download-section"><div class="download-box"><div><p class="eyebrow">Ready when you are</p><h2>A calmer way to manage<br />your laptop’s power.</h2><p>Download Yelly for Windows and keep the controls close.</p></div><div class="download-actions"><a href="/downloads/YellySetup.exe" class="button" download>Download installer <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a><a href="/downloads/Yelly.exe" class="button button-outline" download>Portable app</a></div></div></section>
  </main>

  <footer class="site-footer"><div class="footer-inner"><a class="brand footer-brand" href="#top"><img src="/Yelly.png" alt="" width="27" height="27" /><span>yelly</span></a><p>A small utility for a cooler, more considered setup.</p><div class="footer-links"><a href="https://github.com/heshan-jj/yely-by-jj" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">GitHub</a><a href="https://github.com/heshan-jj/yely-by-jj/releases" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Releases</a><a href="https://github.com/heshan-jj/yely-by-jj/issues" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Report an issue</a></div><small>© 2026 Yelly by JJ</small></div></footer>
</Layout>

<style>
  .site-header{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:10;background:rgba(23,24,27,.9);backdrop-filter:blur(16px);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(64,67,73,.75)}
  .nav-wrap,.section-wrap,.footer-inner{width:min(var(--content-width),calc(100% - 48px));margin-inline:auto}
  .nav-wrap{height:72px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:30px}
  .brand{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-size:20px;font-weight:650;letter-spacing:-.045em}.brand img,.window-mark img{object-fit:contain;filter:brightness(0) invert(1)}.version{font:600 10px var(--font-mono);letter-spacing:.02em;color:var(--text-muted);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:5px;padding:3px 6px;margin-left:2px}
  nav{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:30px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto}nav a,.github-link{color:var(--text-muted);font-size:13px;transition:color .2s}nav a:hover,.github-link:hover{color:var(--text)}.nav-actions{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:23px}.github-link span{color:var(--text-muted);margin-left:3px}
  .button{min-height:46px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:12px;padding:0 18px;border-radius:7px;background:var(--accent);color:#fff;font-size:13px;font-weight:650;box-shadow:0 5px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.18);transition:background .2s,transform .2s}.button:hover{background:var(--accent-hover);transform:translateY(-1px)}.button-small{min-height:37px;padding-inline:14px}.button-outline{background:transparent;border:1px solid var(--border-strong);box-shadow:none;color:var(--text-secondary)}.button-outline:hover{background:var(--surface);color:var(--text)}
  .hero{min-height:660px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:.85fr 1.15fr;align-items:center;gap:64px;padding-top:82px;padding-bottom:88px}.hero-copy{padding-bottom:16px}.eyebrow{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.12em;font:600 10px var(--font-mono);color:var(--text-muted);margin-bottom:20px}.live-dot{display:inline-block;width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--green);box-shadow:0 0 10px rgba(110,214,184,.35)}h1,h2,h3,p{margin:0}.hero h1{font-size:clamp(43px,5.1vw,66px);line-height:1.045;letter-spacing:-.065em;font-weight:620}.hero h1 span,.section-heading h2 span,.monitor-copy h2 span,.controls-copy h2 span,.autopilot-layout h2 span{color:var(--text-muted)}.hero-lede{max-width:460px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;color:var(--text-secondary);margin-top:23px}.hero-actions{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;margin-top:30px}.microcopy{font-size:11px;color:var(--text-muted);margin-top:15px}
  .app-shot{min-width:0;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid #393c42;border-radius:10px;background:var(--side);box-shadow:0 24px 70px rgba(0,0,0,.36)}.shot-top{height:39px;padding:0 12px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;background:#202125;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);font-size:10px;color:var(--text-secondary)}.window-mark{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px}.window-mark img{object-fit:contain}.shot-separator{color:var(--border-strong);margin-inline:2px}.window-controls{height:100%;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;padding-right:2px}.window-controls i{width:9px;height:1px;background:#9b9da2}.window-controls i:nth-child(2){height:8px;border:1px solid #9b9da2;background:transparent}.window-controls i:nth-child(3){width:9px;height:9px;background:linear-gradient(45deg,transparent 46%,#9b9da2 48%,#9b9da2 53%,transparent 55%),linear-gradient(-45deg,transparent 46%,#9b9da2 48%,#9b9da2 53%,transparent 55%)}.app-shot>img{display:block;width:100%;max-width:100%;height:auto}.app-shot figcaption{min-height:39px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:0 14px;color:var(--text-secondary);font-size:10px;border-top:1px solid var(--border)}.caption-note{color:var(--text-muted);margin-left:auto;font-size:9px}
  .trust-strip{border-block:1px solid var(--border);background:rgba(23,24,27,.7)}.strip-inner{width:min(var(--content-width),calc(100% - 48px));min-height:72px;margin:auto;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:18px}.strip-inner span{font-size:11px;color:var(--text-secondary);white-space:nowrap}.strip-inner b{font:500 10px var(--font-mono);color:var(--accent);margin-right:9px}
  .feature-section{padding-top:116px;padding-bottom:125px}.section-heading{display:flex;align-items:end;justify-content:space-between;gap:40px;margin-bottom:45px}.section-heading h2,.monitor-copy h2,.controls-copy h2,.autopilot-layout h2{font-size:clamp(34px,4vw,47px);line-height:1.12;letter-spacing:-.055em;font-weight:600}.section-heading>p{max-width:340px;font-size:13px;color:var(--text-muted);line-height:1.8;padding-bottom:5px}.feature-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:14px}.feature-card{min-height:250px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:9px;background:linear-gradient(145deg,#25272b,#202125);padding:24px;position:relative;overflow:hidden}.feature-card:after{content:"";position:absolute;right:-46px;top:-64px;width:150px;height:150px;border:1px solid rgba(110,214,184,.08);border-radius:50%;box-shadow:0 0 0 18px rgba(110,214,184,.018),0 0 0 38px rgba(110,214,184,.014)}.feature-blue:after{border-color:rgba(35,131,226,.13);box-shadow:0 0 0 18px rgba(35,131,226,.025),0 0 0 38px rgba(35,131,226,.018)}.feature-icon{width:36px;height:36px;display:grid;place-items:center;border:1px solid #31516a;background:var(--accent-tint);border-radius:8px;color:#82baf0;font-size:20px;margin-bottom:23px}.bolt{font-size:26px}.bars{display:flex;align-items:end;justify-content:center;gap:3px}.bars i{width:3px;border-radius:2px;background:var(--green)}.bars i:nth-child(1){height:10px}.bars i:nth-child(2){height:18px}.bars i:nth-child(3){height:14px}.key-icon{border-color:#59432a;background:#3b2d20;color:var(--amber)}.card-kicker{font:600 9px var(--font-mono);letter-spacing:.13em;color:var(--text-muted);margin-bottom:8px}.feature-card h3{font-size:17px;letter-spacing:-.025em;margin-bottom:9px}.feature-card>p:not(.card-kicker){font-size:12px;line-height:1.75;color:var(--text-muted);max-width:300px}.feature-foot{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;position:absolute;bottom:20px;font-size:10px;color:var(--text-secondary)}.status-dot{width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%}.blue-dot{background:#65b4ff}.green-dot{background:var(--green)}.amber-dot{background:var(--amber)}
  .monitor-section{background:var(--side);border-block:1px solid var(--border);padding:105px 0}.monitor-layout{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.77fr 1.23fr;align-items:center;gap:78px}.monitor-copy>p:not(.eyebrow){font-size:13px;color:var(--text-muted);line-height:1.85;margin-top:17px;max-width:395px}.reading-list{list-style:none;display:grid;gap:20px;margin-top:32px}.reading-list li{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:12px}.check{width:20px;height:20px;display:grid;place-items:center;border-radius:50%;color:var(--green);background:var(--green-soft);font-size:12px;flex:none}.reading-list b,.reading-list small{display:block}.reading-list b{font-size:12px;font-weight:600}.reading-list small{color:var(--text-muted);font-size:10px;margin-top:3px}.hardware-shot{box-shadow:0 18px 55px rgba(0,0,0,.28)}
  .controls-section{padding-top:123px;padding-bottom:125px}.controls-layout{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:90px;align-items:center}.controls-copy>p:not(.eyebrow){font-size:13px;line-height:1.85;color:var(--text-muted);max-width:400px;margin-top:18px}.setting-note{display:flex;gap:11px;max-width:410px;padding:14px;margin-top:25px;border:1px solid #31516a;border-radius:7px;background:var(--accent-tint);font-size:10px;line-height:1.65;color:#c1d6e7}.info-icon{width:16px;height:16px;border:1px solid #6ca7d6;border-radius:50%;display:grid;place-items:center;flex:none;font:600 10px var(--font-sans);color:#8bc3f4}.settings-preview{padding:23px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(140deg,#292b30,#222428);box-shadow:0 20px 50px rgba(0,0,0,.22)}.settings-title{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:11px;padding-bottom:19px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}.settings-symbol{width:32px;height:32px;display:grid;place-items:center;border-radius:7px;background:#30343a;color:#b9c1cb;font-size:17px}.settings-title b,.settings-title small{display:block}.settings-title b{font-size:12px}.settings-title small{font:500 8px var(--font-mono);letter-spacing:.1em;color:var(--text-muted);margin-top:4px}.preview-label{margin-left:auto;padding:4px 6px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:4px;color:var(--text-muted);font:500 8px var(--font-mono);letter-spacing:.07em}.setting-row{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px;padding:19px 0 12px}.setting-row>div{flex:1}.setting-row>div b,.setting-row>div small{display:block}.setting-row>div b{font-size:11px;font-weight:550}.setting-row>div small{font-size:9px;color:var(--text-muted);margin-top:4px}.value-pill{min-width:67px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:7px 9px;border:1px solid var(--border-strong);background:#202125;border-radius:5px;font:600 10px var(--font-mono)}.value-pill span{color:var(--text-muted)}.cap-scale{height:3px;background:#41444a;border-radius:5px;margin-top:5px;position:relative}.cap-scale span{display:block;width:96%;height:100%;border-radius:inherit;background:var(--accent)}.cap-scale i{position:absolute;left:96%;top:50%;width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:50%;background:#c8e0f8;border:2px solid var(--accent);transform:translate(-50%,-50%)}.scale-labels{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;color:var(--text-muted);font:9px var(--font-mono);padding-top:9px}.shortcut-row{justify-content:flex-start;padding-top:23px;margin-top:13px;border-top:1px solid var(--border)}.shortcut-row>div{margin-right:auto}kbd{padding:6px 8px;min-width:26px;text-align:center;border:1px solid var(--border-strong);border-radius:5px;background:#1d1e21;color:var(--text-secondary);font:10px var(--font-mono);box-shadow:0 2px 0 #111}.plus{font-size:10px;color:var(--text-muted);font-weight:400;margin-inline:-4px}.settings-hint{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;margin-top:16px;font-size:9px;color:var(--text-muted)}
